<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. sorghum major sales activity in the week ended Aug 29 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:   1995/96		  1996/97</p>
<p> Honduras	4,300	    Japan 15,200</p>
<p> Mexico	  3,300</p>
<p>Net sales of 8,600 tonnes for 1995/96 were 38 percent above the prior week and 69 percent higher than the four-week average.</p>
<p>Weekly exports of 64,800 were down 29 percent from the previous week and down 48 percent from the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Japan, Mexico and Honduras.</p>
</text>
